-- title:
--   Exists Spcc Value One
-- statement:
--   For every compact Pauli-test parameter package $P$, there exists a symmetric Pauli strategy $S$ over the fixed field model of $P$. The strategy is projective, consistent, and support-wise commuting for the prescribed binary representation, and
--
--   $$\operatorname{value}(S,\operatorname{PauliGame}(P))=1.$$
--
--   Here $P$ fixes the field size and game parameters, while $S$ is the witnessing two-player strategy. This is the completeness theorem for the compact Pauli basis test.
